  "implementation": [
    "Reveal Unicode graphemes against the fully shaped layout, using the existing GUI root, focus domain, and actions. Support wrapping, live locale changes, themes, safe areas, and reading preferences.",
    "Confirm reveals then advances. Automatic waits for text, a minimum reading time and current voice. Skip advances only already-read dialogue; mode changes at unread lines, choices and mandatory stage or wait actions.",
    "Keep a bounded history ring and reuse the existing virtual list. Replay the selected voice for the current locale without advancing the story.",
    "Use the original mixer with separately owned voice leases and transient gain on the scene music voice. Use current track, bus and voice values throughout and release pending loads on cancellation."
  ],
